usage: pdf_report.py [-h] [--eda-dir EDA_DIR] [--output OUTPUT]

Build the 16:9 PDF progress deck from the checked EDA outputs.

options:
  -h, --help         show this help message and exit
  --eda-dir EDA_DIR  Input EDA evidence; defaults to frozen main M01
  --output OUTPUT    Generated progress deck; defaults to
                     output/reports/progress_report.pdf
